extends ../layouts/default.pug
include ../mixins/index.pug

block main
  +page-banner({ name: pageTitle }, "/faq")

  section.mt_80.mb_100
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-lg-8
          .accordion#faqAccordion
            .accordion-item.faq-item
              h2.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq1")
                  | What makes Ukraine clothing unique?
              .accordion-collapse.collapse.show#faq1(data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body.faq-body
                  | Our collections draw from centuries of Ukrainian folk art - featuring traditional embroidery (vyshyvanka) patterns, hand-crafted motifs, and color palettes inspired by Ukraine's landscape. Each piece carries cultural meaning and is made with premium materials.

            .accordion-item.faq-item
              h2.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq2")
                  | Do you ship internationally?
              .accordion-collapse.collapse#faq2(data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body.faq-body
                  | Yes! We ship worldwide. International shipping typically takes 7-14 business days depending on your location. Shipping costs are calculated at checkout.

            .accordion-item.faq-item
              h2.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq3")
                  | How do I find the right size?
              .accordion-collapse.collapse#faq3(data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body.faq-body
                  | Each product page includes a detailed size guide. We recommend measuring your chest, waist, and hips and comparing with our size chart. If you are between sizes, we suggest sizing up for comfort.

            .accordion-item.faq-item
              h2.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq4")
                  | Can I cancel or change my order?
              .accordion-collapse.collapse#faq4(data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body.faq-body
                  | Orders can be cancelled or modified within 24 hours of placement. After that, your order may already be in processing. Please contact us immediately at info@uit.edu.vn.

            .accordion-item.faq-item
              h2.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq5")
                  | How do I care for my Ukraine garments?
              .accordion-collapse.collapse#faq5(data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body.faq-body
                  | To preserve embroidery and fabric quality, we recommend hand washing or machine washing on a gentle cold cycle. Avoid bleach. Iron inside out on low heat. Care instructions are also printed on each garment's label.
